  "tests": "All on head f3d1666d9, through os-verify-lock (slot dev-24293). [1] pnpm --workspace-concurrency=2 --filter '@objectstack/lint...' build: VERDICT command-exit 0, with 'check-dts-emitted: @objectstack/lint - 6/6 declared declaration file(s) present'. [2] Old-sentence absence, counted with grep -rF over packages/lint/src and packages/lint/dist (src/dist): 'reaches the data engine as a literal' 0/0, 'renders empty with no error' 0/0, 'sent to the data engine as a literal string' 0/0, 'passed to the data engine' 0/0, 'matches no record, and the surface renders empty' 0/0, 'unresolved placeholder silently matches nothing' 0/0. Positive controls: 'data engine refuses a query carrying it' src 1, dist 4 files; 'The data engine refuses a query that carries it' dist 4 files; 'FILTER_TOKEN_UNKNOWN`, 400). When' present in dist/index.js. The bare phrase 'silently matches nothing' has 1 src hit, lint-flow-patterns.ts:644, an unrelated flow date-equality message. A repo-wide git grep (excluding CHANGELOG.md and this PR's changeset) for 'literal string, matches no', 'surface renders empty', 'sent to the data engine', 'passed to the data engine', 'reaches the data engine as a literal' and 'is not a resolvable placeholder' finds only validate-filter-tokens.ts:241 (the kept first sentence) and validate-filter-tokens.test.ts:298 (its negative pin). [3] pnpm --filter @objectstack/lint exec vitest run --maxWorkers=2: Test Files 144 passed (144), Tests 6858 passed (6858), VERDICT command-exit 0. Round 1's '6853 passed | 5 skipped' were the 5 skipIf cases in lazy-deps.test.ts (2) and runtime-lazy-deps.test.ts (3), which need lint's own dist/. They ran this time, against the rebuilt dist/. [4] pnpm --filter @objectstack/lint typecheck: VERDICT command-exit 0, with 'check:test-typecheck: OK — ... 2 file(s) / 6 error(s) / 2 pinned signature(s) held'. No ablation this round: the diff is a comment and changes no tested behaviour. Round 1's ablation, on the message, stands.",
  "gates": "Local subset: node scripts/pm/dispatch-gates.mjs --commands --repo objectstack-ai/objectstack with no paths, on head f3d1666d9, from merge base 21070a2f0, over 5 paths. The stderr names objectstack-ai/objectstack at f3d1666d9, and --repo holds. 64 commands, the same set as round 1. Each ran with its exit code captured before any pipe. 62 exited 0, check:docs-transcript-drift among them: '4 declared transcript value(s) across 417 page(s) under content/docs/ equal what the registry derives today, and no undeclared block quotes one'. NOT MEASURED, exit 3 PREREQUISITE NOT MET: pnpm check:dual-build-cjs-loads (every package's dist/) and pnpm check:lean-entry-closure (@objectstack/objectql dist/core.*). Reconciliation: node scripts/pm/dispatch-gates.mjs --ran (the round-2 record) --repo objectstack-ai/objectstack exited 0, printing '64 derived famil(ies) accounted for — 62 run, 2 NOT-MEASURED (2 DERIVED from a recorded exit 3)'. Stale-tree warning from the derivation: the tree is at least 5 commits behind origin/main, and 4 gate inputs changed on main across that range (scripts/check-single-authz-resolver.mjs, scripts/slot-lookup-baseline.json, scripts/check-route-envelope.mjs, one scripts/adr-anchors file). The local readings of those families are the base's copies, and CI's merge-ref readings govern. Main was not merged, per the patch round. CI, PR #24312 check-runs at f3d1666d9 when read: 39 runs, 30 success, 6 skipped, 3 in_progress. Success: Auto Label, Build Core, Check Changeset, Check Documentation Links, Check PR Size, Dogfood Regression Gate, Flag docs affected by code changes, Governed Surface Queue Guard, Lint & Repo Gates, all 8 Lint · * lanes, No other open PR may claim the same issue, No other open PR may claim the same single-writer path, Part-of PR must not also close its card, Test Core (1/6), Test Core (5/6), Test Core (6/6), The card this PR closes must claim this branch, Type Check · consumer gates / debt ledger / source gates / workspace,