      "new_str": "Derived on head `f3d1666d9` with `node scripts/pm/dispatch-gates.mjs --commands --repo objectstack-ai/objectstack`, no paths given (change set: these 5 files vs merge base `21070a2f0`). That gives 64 commands, the same set as on `6be194c50`, and 11 more than the claim's path-only lead of 53. The extra 11 are the changeset-kind families. Each was run with its exit code captured before any pipe, and the record was reconciled with `--ran`: \"64 derived famil(ies) accounted for — 62 run, 2 NOT-MEASURED (2 DERIVED from a recorded exit 3)\", exit 0.\n\n- 62 exited 0, `pnpm check:docs-transcript-drift` among them, since lint's `dist/` was built this time. On `6be194c50`, 61 exited 0 on the first pass."
