      "old_str": "- `pnpm check:docs-transcript-drift` exited 3 on the first pass (PREREQUISITE NOT MET: no `packages/lint/dist`). After `pnpm --filter @objectstack/lint build` it exited 0:",
      "new_str": "- `pnpm check:docs-transcript-drift`: on `6be194c50` it exited 3 on the first pass (PREREQUISITE NOT MET: no `packages/lint/dist`), then 0 after a lint build. On `f3d1666d9` it exited 0:"
