      "old_str": "- `origin/main` moved 3 commits past the base while this ran (`2ee5861b0`, `0c3db0f6a`, `30da04f8e`). None of them touches `packages/lint`, its build closure, or `packages/core/src/utils/filter-tokens.ts`. The branch is not merged with them, and CI runs on GitHub's merge ref.",
      "new_str": "- `origin/main` has moved past the base (`2ee5861b0`, `0c3db0f6a`, `30da04f8e` and later). None of these commits touches `packages/lint`, its build closure, or `packages/core/src/utils/filter-tokens.ts`. The branch is not merged with them, as the patch round directs, and CI runs on GitHub's merge ref. The derivation on `f3d1666d9` flags 4 gate inputs that changed on `main` across that range: `scripts/check-single-authz-resolver.mjs`, `scripts/slot-lookup-baseline.json`, `scripts/check-route-envelope.mjs` and one `scripts/adr-anchors/` file. Their local readings are of the base's copies, and CI's readings on the merge ref are the ones that count."
