      "old_str": "- **`packages/lint/src/authoring-rules.ts:917`–`:920` carries the same false sentence**, in the comment above `validateFilterTokens`' registration: \"reaches the data engine as a literal and matches nothing. The surface renders empty with no error\". It is a code comment, not shipped text. It is left because the file is outside this card's claimed file surface. Either a follow-up commit on this branch after the claim is amended, or a later edit of that file, makes it say what the message now says. Carrier: none.\n",
